  "title": "Chandrayaan-2 CLASS L2 Elemental Abundance Maps",
  "description": "Elemental abundance values (Al, Fe, Mg, Na, Si) derived from the Chandrayaan-2 CLASS X-ray fluorescence spectrometer at a fixed 150 km (along-track) x 12.5 km (across-track) ground pixel size (Narendranath et al. 2024b). Coverage follows sparse orbital ground tracks rather than a filled global grid, since L2 retrievals require periods of elevated solar X-ray activity. Values in wt%.",
